# Copied to .env by `task init`. The Taskfile loads .env; keep it untracked.

# 40-character SHA-1 of your local code-signing certificate, from
# `security find-identity -v -p codesigning`. Stable signing keeps macOS privacy
# grants such as Accessibility across `task copy:release` installs. Empty means
# ad-hoc builds, which `task copy:release` refuses. See docs/development.md.
PANELCTL_SIGNING_IDENTITY=
